# back/greatsword: the greatsword in its scabbard across the back (`sheath greatsword`: P2C_CONTRACTS 3; STYLE_P2 11 and
# 25.7), P2c wave 2 WEAPONS. The hilt rides over the right shoulder (the brass cross, a 6 px leather grip, the pommel), the
# leather scabbard (dark-outlined, a brass throat, a steel chape) runs down the back to the left hip; behind the body
# facing down and in the side views, over the back facing up. Sheath channel: rest kick lag sit stride; drawn keeps the
# empty scabbard (the sword is in both hands); lie draws nothing (back items lie under the body). On the neck anchor.
# Drafted with the area's stepper (src/backs.py) and hand-checked at 12x. Finish regions: R the guard, pommel and throat,
# G the pommel.
use person
body adult
role sheath greatsword
anchor neck
keys sheath

